🧠 Context
The Template model has been enhanced with additional fields including:

1. Array fields:
   - styleTags - Array of style tags
   - searchKeywords - Array of search keywords
   - relatedTemplates - Array of related template IDs

2. Metrics fields:
   - viewCount - Number 
   - sharedCount - Number
   - downloadCount - Number
   - reportCount - Number
   - rating - Number
   - ratingCount - Number

3. Type and pricing:
