### 📱 Device Support Matrix:
- **Android 8.0+ (API 26+)**: Full PiP support with premium features
- **Android 7.0-7.1 (API 24-25)**: Edge-to-edge only, PiP fallback to fullscreen
- **Android 6.0 (API 23)**: Basic edge-to-edge, legacy fullscreen mode
- **Below Android 6.0**: Standard fullscreen with compatibility warnings

